:: Street Alex Cafe
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"Would you like to get something to eat?" you ask.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Want to grab a bite to eat?" you ask.
	<<else>>
		"Fancy a bite to eat?" you ask.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	Alex's smile broadens. "I'm glad you asked."
	<br><br>
<</if>>

You accompany Alex to a small cafe at the corner of the street. They serve sandwiches and small cakes, as well as tea, coffee, and fizzy drinks.
<br><br>

Alex chats about the farm, <<his>> doings, and the town between mouthfuls of sandwich.
<<if $rng gte 67>>
	"I doubt the cakes are any good here," <<he>> says, keeping <<his>> voice low. "Not compared to what my parents make." 
<<elseif $rng gte 33>>
	"Not a bad place," <<he>> says. "For the town. The drinks are cold, at least."
<<else>>
	"Some of the clubs in town are cool," <<he>> says at one point.
	<<if $farm_stage gte 7>>
		Then <<he>> looks away, abashed, as if <<he>> said something <<he>> shouldn't.
	<<else>>
		"I'll have to invite you along sometime."
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Whitney.init is 1 and !["dungeon", "pillory"].includes(C.npc.Whitney.state) and !$whitneySeen.includes("Alex")>>
	<<npc Whitney 2>><<person2>>
	You see movement in the corner of your eye, through the window. <span class="red">It's Whitney,</span> walking by with <<his>> friends.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Don't react|Street Alex Cafe React Intro]]>><</link>><<difficulty 50>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Dive under the table to hide|Street Alex Cafe Dive Intro]]>><</link>><<difficulty 50>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Drag Alex under the table to hide|Street Alex Cafe Drag Intro]]>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 1 16000>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Wave to Whitney|Street Alex Cafe Wave Intro]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	Satisfied, Alex leaves the cafe with you. "Better head back," <<he>> says. "Lots of work to do. Nice seeing you." <<He>> walks away.
	<br><br>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<</if>>


:: Street Alex Well
<<effects>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I hope you're have a pleasant day," you say.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Hope the day's treating you right," you say.
<<else>>
	"I hope you're having a good day," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"You too," Alex says. "Well, I'd better get back to work. See you." <<He>> walks away.
<br><br>

<<destinationeventend>>

:: Street Alex Well Busy
<<effects>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I have bits and bobs to do," you give the impression of a bow. "Sorry."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I'm busy at the moment," you say.
<<else>>
	"I have things to do I'm afraid," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Alex nods. "Don't worry. I should really be working too. See you are the farm." <<He>> walks away.
<br><br>

<<destinationeventend>>

:: Street Alex Ignore
<<effects>>

You ignore Alex, and walk on as if <<he>> isn't there.

<<if $farm_stage gte 7 and C.npc.Alex.dom gte random(1, 100)>>
	"Hey," <<he>> says, grabbing your arm from behind. "Have I done something wrong? I was hoping we could grab a bite to eat or something."
	<br><br>
	
	<<link [[Grab a bite to eat|Street Alex Cafe]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Shake <<him>> off|Street Alex Shake]]>><<npcincr Alex love -1>><</link>><<llove>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<He>> lets you go.
	<br><br>
	
	<<destinationeventend>>
<</if>>

