:: Street Alex Cafe React Intro
<<effects>>

You don't react. 
<<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
	Whitney and <<person2>><<his>> friends walk right by the window, <span class="green">without noticing you.</span>
	<br><br>
	
	Alex tucks into <<person1>><<his>> sandwich, none the wiser, until <<he>> finishes the last crumb. Satisfied, Alex leaves the cafe with you. "Better head back," <<he>> says. "Lots of work to do. Nice seeing you." <<He>> walks away.
	<br><br>
	<<destinationeventend>>
<<else>>
	Whitney and <<person2>><<his>> friends walk right by the window. Whitney halts, grins, <span class="red">then turns <<his>> head your way.</span>

