:: Street Alex Cafe Whitney Intro Bully
<<effects>>

<<person2>>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"That's Whitney," you say, and your voice catches. "<<He>> bullies me at school."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Whitney. <<He>> hassles me at school," you say. "Nothing I can't handle."
<<else>>
	"That's Whitney. <<He>> bullies me at school," you say. "<<He>> might be about to cause trouble."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $farm_stage gte 7>>
	Alex's expression darkens. <<person1>><<He>> looks at Whitney enter the cafe, and rises to <<his>> feet, as if in no hurry.
	<br><br>
	"Well if it isn't my slut," Whitney says, walking over with <<person2>><<his>> friends in tow.
	<br><br>
