	<br><br>
	"Who the fuck are you?" Whitney asks. "And why do you have my slut?"
	<br><br>
	"Stay away from my friend," Alex replies, unconcerned by Whitney's gang arriving to flank <<person2>><<him>>. "Whatever you've been doing to <<phim>>, it stops now, understood?"
